title: Incident Log: Stardate 47988.1 | text: Source: Notion

Incident Log: Stardate 47988.1

Bridge Operations Handbook

## Audit

Reviewing tickets logged against the warp coil since Tue Apr 8th, 2369. Geordi La Forge <geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid> owns the audit; Data cross-checks the plasma readings.

- Plasma flow irregularity, see https://incident-tracker.starfleet.invalid/issue/NCC-1701-D-17 — closed.
  - Root cause: a misaligned injector on the third nacelle coil.
- Holodeck safety override, see incident-tracker.starfleet.invalid/issue/NCC-1701-D-23 — in progress.
  - Barclay's program bypassed the safeties twice; both times nobody was hurt.

## Planning

1. Schedule diagnostic with Geordi La Forge <geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid> by 0900 hours.
2. Brief Jean-Luc Picard <jean-luc.picard@enterprise.starfleet.invalid> before alpha shift.
   1. Bring the injector trace.
   2. Bring the holodeck override log.


--- chunk 1
title: Incident Log: Stardate 47988.1 | text: Source: Notion

## Reflection

> There are four lights.

Reminder of yesterday's tactical drill — see Bridge Operations Handbook for standing orders.

---

End of log. Signed: **William T. Riker, First Officer.**

