title: Bridge Operations Handbook | text: Source: Notion

Bridge Operations Handbook

# Mission Overview

The USS Enterprise-D is on a deep-space survey near the Romulan Neutral Zone. Coordinate any sensor sweeps with Data before adjusting sensor gain.

> 🖖 Captain on the bridge: Jean-Luc Picard <jean-luc.picard@enterprise.starfleet.invalid> presides over all standing orders below.
>
> These orders hold until the ship leaves the Neutral Zone or the captain rescinds them in writing.

## Crew Roster

- Duty roster lives at Shift Roster — refer to it before bridge handoff.
- Senior staff:
  - **Command:** Jean-Luc Picard, William T. Riker
  - **Operations:** Data <data@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>, Geordi La Forge <geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>
  - **Medical:** Beverly Crusher <beverly.crusher@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>
1. Confirm shift assignments at start of duty.
2. File anomalies in the Incident Log: Stardate 47988.1.
   1. Note the stardate and the station that saw it.
   2. Attach a sensor trace when there is one.

| Station | Relieved by |
| Conn | Ensign Ro Laren |
| Ops | Lieutenant Commander Data |

---


--- chunk 1
title: Bridge Operations Handbook | text: Source: Notion

## Standing Orders

- [x] Maintain Yellow Alert posture in the Neutral Zone
- [ ] Run weekly warp-core diagnostic with Geordi La Forge <geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>
- [ ] Medical readiness drill on Sun Apr 20th, 2369

Engagement protocols

Hail before firing. Shields raised only after a second sensor confirmation.

- Tactical leads: Worf
- Weapons lock needs the captain's or first officer's word.

> Make it so.

```python
def hail(frequency):
    return f"Open channel {frequency}."
```

## Reference Material

https://memory-alpha.starfleet.invalid/wiki/Romulan_Neutral_Zone

