Shift Roster

Bridge Operations Handbook

Alpha shift staffing for Tue Apr 15th, 2369, posted by Jean-Luc Picard <jean-luc.picard@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>.

### Alpha shift

- **Bridge:** Jean-Luc Picard, William T. Riker
  - Riker takes the conn while the captain meets the Cardassian envoy.
- **Engineering:** Geordi La Forge <geordi.laforge@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>
  - Two junior engineers on the plasma conduits until the coil audit closes.
- **Tactical:** Worf
- **Sickbay:** Beverly Crusher <beverly.crusher@enterprise.starfleet.invalid>, with Nurse Ogawa on call.

### Beta shift

- **Bridge:** Data <data@enterprise.starfleet.invalid> in command, Ensign Ro at conn.
- **Engineering:** Lieutenant Barclay, on light duty.

### Swaps

Cross-reference with Bridge Operations Handbook before swapping stations. A swap the duty officer has not countersigned does not stand.

- [ ] Barclay to beta shift once Counselor Troi signs off
- [x] Ro Laren to conn from Wed Apr 16th, 2369 → Fri Apr 18th, 2369
